{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440600/extras/purp_v_yellow_banner.png?t=1743819186\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WELCOME TO THE WORLD OF FORKLIFT COMBAT!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In an alternate universe, <strong>Forklift Combat</strong> reigns as the world's most popular sport. Forklifts everywhere gather to witness the ultimate showdown\u2014where only the best can earn the prestigious <strong>Forklift Certification</strong> and climb the corporate <strong>Forklift Ladder</strong> to glory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FORK UP YOUR FRIENDS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Get ready for <strong>hilarious, chaotic battles</strong> in this online and local party game for <strong>2-4 players</strong>. Whether you're duking it out from the couch or your gamer cave, one thing's for sure\u2014only the strongest (and most reckless) Forklift operators will survive!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BATTLE YOUR FRIENDS</strong> \u2013 Face off in wild <strong>1v1 duels</strong> or up to 4 players with <strong>online and local multiplayer</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440600/extras/team_fight.gif?t=1743819186\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CHOOSE YOUR FORKLIFT</strong> \u2013 Pick from a cast of <strong>quirky, over-the-top Forklifts</strong>, each with their own distinct style and personality. Whether you want to be an average Joe trying to get through his long work hours, or a literal raccoon- we've got you covered!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440600/extras/customization.gif?t=1743819186\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WHAT THE FORK?!</strong> \u2013 Use <strong>wacky items</strong> and interact with chaotic <strong>environmental hazards,</strong> and <strong>crazy  maps</strong> to gain the upper hand (or just cause total mayhem). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440600/extras/item_usage.gif?t=1743819186\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>THE FORKLIFTS ARE WHERE?</strong> \u2013 Battle across a variety of <strong>crazy, dynamic maps, </strong>from ancient temples to the middle of outer space\u2014each packed with unique twists, traps, and opportunities for forklift carnage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440600/extras/map.gif?t=1743819186\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MASTER THE ART OF THE FORK</strong> \u2013 <strong>Drift, clash, and launch your opponents</strong> with tight, fluid movement mechanics. Precision and strategy (or just dumb luck) will determine the champion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440600/extras/clash.gif?t=1743819186\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CLASH IT UP -\u00a0 </strong>Sparks light up when your forks collide. Use quick keys to win against clash tournaments and launch your opponent into the stratosphere! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DO YOU HAVE WHAT IT TAKES TO GET CERTIFIED?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hop in, rev up, and <strong>fork 'em up!</strong> \ud83c\udfc6</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440600/extras/red_v_blue_banner.png?t=1743819186\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2440600?t=1743819186","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/store